5
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.230
If you need help starting a business,

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.120
you go and see a commercial lawyer.

7
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.360
If you're going through a divorce,

8
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.350
you go and see a family lawyer.

9
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.510
Or if you need help drafting a will,

10
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.550
you go and see a wills and estates lawyer.

11
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.790
But the reality is that these three issues are not separate.

12
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.680
They're part of your life story.

13
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.035
And that is where I'm different

14
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.180
and where my firm is different.

15
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.450
We believe that we need to take

16
00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:40.480
a tailored and bespoke approach to every single client

17
00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.880
to ensure that they are best protected

18
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.710
from anything that might happen.

19
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.140
If you need that expert advice,

20
00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.990
and you want the right person to speak to,

21
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.180
don't hesitate to reach out today.
